  "title": "It’s Been 41 Years Since Baseball Has Seen a Pair of Cy Young Winners Like This",
  "subtitle": null,
  "byline": null,
  "publishedAt": null,
  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!HtU4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89fd8323-7a19-44ae-bbe8-1ff1f53969f6_1900x1250.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!HtU4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89fd8323-7a19-44ae-bbe8-1ff1f53969f6_1900x1250.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"958\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption><strong>Original credit: </strong>Getty</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Within a month of each other in the summer of 2025, Jacob Misiorowski of the Brewers (<a href=\"https://www.baseball-reference.com/tools/route.cgi?dest=debut&amp;id=misioja01&amp;game_id=MIL202506120\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">June 12</a>) and Cam Schlittler of the Yankees (<a href=\"https://www.baseball-reference.com/tools/route.cgi?dest=debut&amp;id=schlica01&amp;game_id=NYA202507090\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">July 9</a>) were making their Major League debuts. Roughly three months later, the duo then made their first postseason appearances as well — Schlittler <a href=\"https://www.baseball-reference.com/boxes/NYA/NYA202510020.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">went 8 innings</a> with a <a href=\"https://substack.com/@neilpaine/note/c-162414156\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">stellar 84 Game Score</a> in an elimination contest against the rival Red Sox, while Misiorowski <a href=\"https://www.baseball-reference.com/boxes/MIL/MIL202510060.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">wowed in relief</a> against the rival Cubs four days later. And following a pair of elite sophomore campaigns — Schlittler <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/190966113/2026-mlb-wins-above-replacement-leaderboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">had the second-most Wins Above Replacement</a> (WAR) of any player in baseball, trailing only Pete Crow-Armstrong, while Misiorowski ranked fifth — the two young aces are poised to pull off a rare double in <a href=\"https://www.mlb.com/news/when-are-2026-mlb-awards-announced-mvp-cy-young-rookie-of-the-year#:~:text=Nov.%2011%3A%20BBWAA%20Cy%20Young%20Awards%20(7%20p.m.%20ET%20on%20MLB%20Network%2C%20MLB%2B)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">tonight’s Cy Young Award presentations</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/subscribe?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n<p>By now, there isn’t much doubt that Misiorowski and Schlittler will be collecting their hardware tonight — both are listed as 99 percent to win in the prediction markets for the <a href=\"https://kalshi.com/markets/kxmlbnlcy/pro-baseball-national-league-cy-young?op_market_ticker=KXMLBNLCY-26-JMIS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NL</a> and <a href=\"https://kalshi.com/markets/kxmlbalcy/x/kxmlbalcy-26?op_market_ticker=KXMLBALCY-26-CSCH&amp;op_side=buy&amp;op_order_side=yes&amp;op_order_type=dollars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AL</a>, respectively. Here’s a look at how the Kalshi odds for both evolved as the second half of the MLB season progressed:</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!KTr_!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb2da81fb-b1ce-4e07-ab70-83b2dcf5909a_1900x1647.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!KTr_!,w_2400,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb2da81fb-b1ce-4e07-ab70-83b2dcf5909a_1900x1647.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"780\" data-size=\"large\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<p>Assuming they do win in tandem as expected, Misiorowski and Schlittler will become just the fourth pair of Cy Young pitchers to sweep the awards at the ages of 25 or younger, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cy_Young_Award#Winners\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">since the two-league format was introduced</a> in 1967: </p>\n<p>\n          <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/its-been-41-years-since-baseball\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>",
